===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|cunst|lang=dum}}, {{term|const|lang=dum}}, {{term|cunste|lang=dum}}, {{term|conste||skill, ability, knowledge, craft|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term/t|odt|*kunst||knowledge, know-how, skill}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*kunstiz||knowledge, ability}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nl}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*ǵenH-}}, {{term/t|ine-pro|*ǵnō-||to know}}, equivalent to ''[[kunnen|kun(nen)]]'' + ''[[-st#Dutch|-st]]''. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|kunst||skill, wisdom|lang=osx}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|kunst||knowledge, wisdon, skill|lang=goh}}, {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{term|kunst|lang=ofs}}, {{term|konst|lang=ofs}}, {{term|kenst||knowledge|lang=ofs}}. More at {{l|en|cunning}}.

